  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.oth3r.one/-vzoWn9GceE/more_heart_types_banner.png\" alt=\"More Heart Types Banner\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/Oth3r/MoreHeartTypes/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/c7fd18efdadd1c3f12ae56b49afd834640d2d797/assets/cozy/documentation/issues_64h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"issues\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.oth3r.one%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/cozy/social/discord-singular_64h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"discord\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fplugin%252fotterlib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.oth3r.one/-a7bWaVAVW5/requires_otterlib.png\" alt=\"otterlib_dep\"></a></p>\n<p>一款在受到特定类型伤害时显示更多心形纹理的模组。你可以在配置文件中自定义每种心形的显示效果！</p>\n<p><strong>运行此模组需要 OtterLib，你可以在此 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fotterlib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">找到它</a>。</strong></p>\n<h2>查看我的其他项目！</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcaligo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Oth3r/Caligo/blob/master/media/promo_badge.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Caligo badge\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fdirectionhud\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Oth3r/DirectionHUD/blob/master/media/mod-badge.png?raw=true\" alt=\"DirectionHUD badge\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsit!\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Oth3r/Sit/blob/master/media/badge.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Sit! badge\"></a></p>\n<h2>🗃️ 自定义心形配置</h2>\n<p>使用心形配置文件来自定义每种心形的显示效果。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.oth3r.one/-JUoK99qhTt\" alt=\"Heart Config\"></p>\n<h2>🩷 当前所有自定义心形：</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Oth3r/MoreHeartTypes/blob/master/media/MoreHeartTypes - Drowning.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"drowning hearts\">\n<img src=\"https://github.com/Oth3r/MoreHeartTypes/blob/master/media/MoreHeartTypes - Flame.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"flame hearts\">\n<img src=\"https://github.com/Oth3r/MoreHeartTypes/blob/master/media/MoreHeartTypes - Hunger.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"hunger hearts\">\n<img src=\"https://github.com/Oth3r/MoreHeartTypes/blob/master/media/MoreHeartTypes - Pricked.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"pricked hearts\">\n<img src=\"https://github.com/Oth3r/MoreHeartTypes/blob/master/media/MoreHeartTypes - Suffocation.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"suffocation hearts\">\n<img src=\"https://github.com/Oth3r/MoreHeartTypes/blob/master/media/MoreHeartTypes - Void.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"void hearts\"></p>\n<h2>🔗 下载链接</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmore-heart-types\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/c7fd18efdadd1c3f12ae56b49afd834640d2d797/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_64h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"modrinth\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-heart-types\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/c7fd18efdadd1c3f12ae56b49afd834640d2d797/assets/cozy/available/curseforge_64h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"curseforge\"></a></p>",
